{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 10, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: y' = y\n  ucas: y(0) = 1\n  ucas: dsolve y\ny' = y, y(0) = 1\n  (on [0, 10]; 'dsolve y to T' for another end)\n  linear with constant coefficients: eigenvalues 1\n  y(t) = exp(t)\n  check: satisfies the equations at 201 points of [0, 10] (max relative residual 0) and the initial values\n  numeric (Dormand-Prince 5(4), adaptive, 271 steps) agrees with it to 4.3e-06\n      t            y(t)\n      0            1\n      1            2.718281828\n      2            7.389056099\n      3            20.08553692\n      4            54.59815003\n      5            148.4131591\n      6            403.4287935\n      7            1096.633158\n      8            2980.957987\n      9            8103.083928\n      10           22026.46579\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 10, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "solve y' = y with y(0) = 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["y' = y", "y(0) = 1", "dsolve y"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "dsolve", "var": "t", "from": 0, "to": 10, "symbolic": true, "method": "eigenvalues 1", "solution": {"y": "exp(t)"}, "function": "y", "table": [[0, 1], [1, 2.718281828459045], [2, 7.38905609893065], [3, 20.085536923187668], [4, 54.598150033144236], [5, 148.4131591025766], [6, 403.4287934927351], [7, 1096.6331584284585], [8, 2980.9579870417283], [9, 8103.083927575384], [10, 22026.465794806718]]}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "residual", "points": 201, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "satisfies the equations and the initial values"}, {"kind": "numeric_solution", "points": 11, "max_diff": 4.3305481085553765e-06, "passed": false, "text": "Dormand-Prince 5(4) against the symbolic solution"}], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: y' = y\n  ucas: y(0) = 1\n  ucas: dsolve y\ny' = y, y(0) = 1\n  (on [0, 10]; 'dsolve y to T' for another end)\n  linear with constant coefficients: eigenvalues 1\n  y(t) = exp(t)\n  check: satisfies the equations at 201 points of [0, 10] (max relative residual 0) and the initial values\n  numeric (Dormand-Prince 5(4), adaptive, 271 steps) agrees with it to 4.3e-06\n      t            y(t)\n      0            1\n      1            2.718281828\n      2            7.389056099\n      3            20.08553692\n      4            54.59815003\n      5            148.4131591\n      6            403.4287935\n      7            1096.633158\n      8            2980.957987\n      9            8103.083928\n      10           22026.46579\n"}, "isError": false}}
